 R←Test_UC_026(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;rc;msg;result;stop;C
⍝ Runs ]Init and answers "no". <UC.Init> had no :Else, so `r` was never assigned and the
⍝ dispatcher ended in a VALUE ERROR rather than reporting that nothing was done.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed
 stop←0

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 C←∆GetRefToCommTools
 C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'InitFolder@' 'n'

 (rc msg result)←stop ∆UCMD'Init "',tempDir,'"'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp'Cancelled by user'≢∊result
 →T.GoToTidyUp FilesAndDirs.IsDir tempDir,'/.git'   ⍝ Nothing was initialised

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 C.Cleanup
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
